message: "If you use this project, please cite it as below."
title: "Research Atlas: a map of research papers by meaning, citation and lineage"
abstract: >-
  A research-discovery platform built on PostgreSQL 18, with role-based access and row-level security enforced
  in the database, and a Neo4j knowledge graph with vector search and graph algorithms, fed by a transactional
  outbox. DBMS mini-project, PES University, 2026.
